<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The statues of the Lord are right,</l><l>Rejoicing the heart:</l><l>The commandment of the Lord is pure,</l><l>Enlightening the eyes.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The fear of the Lord is clean,</l><l>Enduring forever;</l><l>The judgments of the Lord are true</l><l>And righteous altogether.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
